      "id": "claim_8ac105d25dbd4612b11232201fa7237c",
      "statement": "The flux-local GitHub workflow gates PRs to main with a pre-job that filters changed files to kubernetes/**, and a test job running `flux-local test --enable-helm --all-namespaces --sources flux-system` over kubernetes/flux/cluster in the allenporter flux-local v8.4.0 container; both validation jobs are skipped when no kubernetes/ files changed.",
