      "id": "claim_54f8509236ac4137b66a8d4814e8a5f0",
      "statement": "The flux-local diff job runs in a matrix over helmrelease and kustomization resources, checks out both the PR branch and the default branch, strips volatile Helm attributes, and posts the rendered manifest diff as a PR comment; a final flux-local-status job fails if test or diff failed.",
