    {
      "id": "claim_a2c22ea180ce458d9336f0fc9f839858",
      "statement": "Renovate automerges GitHub Actions (minor/patch/digest) and mise tool (minor/patch) updates with ignoreTests: true, so those updates bypass the flux-local CI gate; safety relies instead on digest-pinned actions and minimumReleaseAge: 3 days for actions. Its flux/helm-values/kubernetes/kustomize managers cover kubernetes/**/*.yaml (including .j2), encrypted **/*.sops.* files are ignored, updates run on an 'every weekend' schedule in grouped PRs, and semantic commit types mark patches (fix), minors (feat), and majors (feat...!:).",
